    "descriptions": [
      {
        "descriptionType": "Abstract",
        "description": "An updated geologic map of the Uranian moon Titania is now available on ArcGIS Pro. These updated maps are part of the \"FOUNDATION FOR EXPLORING THE MOONS OF THE URANIAN SYSTEM: FIRST STEPS\" research project. A research project aimed at updating the original paper maps that were made based on the data prvided by the Voyager 2's 1986 flyby of the gas giant, Uranus.\u00a0"
      }
